Kickolé realistic assets
========================

kickole_player_v4.glb and kickole_player_v4_lod1.glb
----------------------------------------------------
The body, head, face and helper meshes (eyes, teeth, eyelashes, hair shells)
are derived from the MakeHuman hm08 base mesh, released under CC0 1.0
Universal in September 2020 by MakeHuman (Data Collection AB / Palmius /
Hauquier). The source file is vendored at
tools/realistic/sources/makehuman-hm08-base.obj.

https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
http://www.makehumancommunity.org/

The shirt, shorts, socks, boots, skin/cloth/leather textures, skeleton and
animation clips (Idle, KickLeft, KickRight, Miss, Celebrate) are original
works created for this repository and may be redistributed with the game,
including as a binary glTF inside a web build. No club, league or real-player
likeness is included. Rebuild with `npm run build:player`.

This project does not ship Sketchfab or Mixamo characters.

